    "traits": "Attack, Invocation, Water",
    "description": "<p><strong>ATTACK INVOCATION WATER</strong></p>\n<p>You call forth a powerful blast of pressurized water that bludgeons the target and knocks it back. If the spell attack hits it inflicts 4d4 bludgeoning damage.</p>\n<p>If the spell inflicts a critical injury with a severity of serious or greater, the target is also pushed back 5 feet.</p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> the spell attack and its 4d4 bludgeoning; on a serious or deadly critical the target is pushed 5 feet straight away from you (a wall stops it, as a Shove does). (Inner Tempest, Chapter 8; brought into Block 5 by Graham's ruling B5-1 for Elemental Power, and its push in Block 8, B8-9.)</p>"
